ch genre</p> </figcaption> </figure><p>But first, the priorities. For each =
Genre, each design phase is described as either:
</p><ul><li>Very/Quite Important (+++/++) - More than 20% of time allotted,=
 at least two design phases set to at least 40% of time allotted for each g=
ame</li>
<li>Not very important (~) - No requirements</li>
<li>Not/Not at all important (--/---) - Less than 40% of time allotted</li>=
</ul>
<p>Some topics have overrides that change these values to the following:
</p>
